<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-AMSERV SELLS RECORD NUMBER OF CARS IN MAY.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-AMSERV SELLS RECORD NUMBER OF CARS IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amserv Group, which closes its share issue tomorrow, said on Monday it sold 169 cars in May, a record number and up over two times from the previous month.</p>
<p>Amserv, the representative of Toyota and Opel, has sold 440 cars from January to May.</p>
<p>Some 1,080 cars were sold in May in Estonia which gives Amserv a market share of 15.6 percent, the group said in a statement.</p>
<p>Amserv is issuing 100,000 new shares.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
